# Sentinel website — environment variables
#
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL. The site builds and runs with none of them set;
# the defaults are what a fresh Vercel deploy should use. Nothing in this file is
# a secret — they are all public build-time values.

# ── Search engine verification ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Search Console "HTML-tag verification" token. When set, emits
# <meta name="google-site-verification">. Leave unset and no placeholder ships.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# Bing Webmaster Tools site verification. Emits
# <meta name="msvalidate.01">.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# ── Social attribution ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only set this if you have verified the handle exists. An incorrect handle
# renders as a broken attribution link on every social card, which is worse than
# no attribution at all. Accepts "name" or "@name".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_X_HANDLE=

# Extra `sameAs` entries for the Organization JSON-LD.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LINKEDIN_URL=
